{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgs9LdPWLM8GvfKXxEkj5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Found a real bug: in game 103 my net filled its own (false) eye at (5,3), killing a 16-stone group, because the \"defend a ≤2-liberty group\" bonus (8 per adjacent stone ×4 neighbours) outweighed the self-atari penalty — even though filling a point with no empty neighbours adds no liberties. Fix: gate the whole tactics unit (atari-moves and defence bonuses) by the self-atari indicator, so these bonuses vanish at self-atari points (real captures are a separate unit and unaffected).\n\n```python\nsrc=open('/work/build8.py').read()\nold=\"\"\"        u=F.u('TAC',p)\n        for q in nb(p):\n            F.W[E.u('L2O',q),u]+=cfg['w_at']\n            F.W[E.u('L2M',q),u]+=cfg['w_esc']\"\"\"\nnew=\"\"\"        u=F.u('TAC',p)\n        for q in nb(p):\n            F.W[E.u('L2O',q),u]+=cfg['w_at']\n            F.W[E.u('L2M',q),u]+=cfg['w_esc']\n        F.W[E.u('SA',p),u]-=cfg.get('tac_sa_gate',0.0)\"\"\"\nassert old in src; src=src.replace(old,new); open('/work/build8.py','w').write(src)\nexec(open('/work/build8.py').read())\nimport json\ncfg=json.load(open('/work/cfg_v26.json')); cfg.update(tac_sa_gate=100.0)\narrs,layout=build8(cfg,inp)\nfor k,v in arrs.items(): save(k,v)\njson.dump(cfg,open('/work/cfg_v27.json','w'))\nprint(cfg)\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2397,"cache_read_input_tokens":472529,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2397},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7058487b-e813-4267-8caf-88948278edbe","uuid":"5280f3a6-edbe-48c4-bbfe-2192eb6db1e0","timestamp":"2026-11-09T09:49:34.797Z","request_i